*>   2009-10-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 784
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0015.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CREDIT-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 GROSS-INCOME       PIC 9(7)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 CARD-LIMIT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM ASSIGN-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CARD-LIMIT=" CARD-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
ASSIGN-LIMIT.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 600
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 750
            COMPUTE CARD-LIMIT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 0.25
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 640
            COMPUTE CARD-LIMIT = GROSS-INCOME * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 500 TO CARD-LIMIT
    END-EVALUATE.
